# Flutter Service Rules

## File Location & Naming

All services → `lib/services/` — use snake_case ending in `_service.dart`.

## Patterns

### Static-method service (most common)

```dart
class MyFeatureService {
  MyFeatureService._(); // prevent instantiation

  static const String _kDataKey = 'my_feature_data_v1'; // versioned key

  static Future<List<MyModel>> loadAll({required SharedPreferences prefs}) async {
    final raw = prefs.getString(_kDataKey);
    if (raw == null) return [];
    // parse and return
  }

  static Future<void> save(MyModel item, {required SharedPreferences prefs}) async {
    // serialise and store
    await prefs.setString(_kDataKey, /* encoded */);
  }
}
```

### Singleton service (for long-running/stateful services)

```dart
class MyFeatureService {
  MyFeatureService._internal();
  static final MyFeatureService instance = MyFeatureService._internal();

  Future<void> start() async { ... }
  Future<void> stop() async { ... }
}
```

## SharedPreferences Key Naming

Always version keys to allow future migrations:
```dart
static const String _kMyKey = 'feature_name_v1';
```

Never reuse old key names after a format change — bump the version suffix.

## Error Handling

```dart
// Return null / empty for "not found" — don't throw
static Future<MyModel?> find(String id, {required SharedPreferences prefs}) async {
  // ...
  return null; // not found
}

// Wrap Firebase / network calls
try {
  await Firebase.doSomething();
} catch (_) {
  // Firebase is non-fatal — app continues
}
```

## Existing Services — Do Not Duplicate

| Capability | Use |
|---|---|
| Auth / user ID | `DvAuthService` |
| Date "today" | `LogicalDateService` |
| Settings / theme | `AppSettingsService` |
| Notifications | `NotificationsService` |
| Ads | `AdService` |
| Subscriptions | `SubscriptionService` |
| Affirmations | `AffirmationService` |
| Wizard defaults | `WizardDefaultsService` |
| Background sync | `AutoSyncService` |
| Drive backup | `BackupService` |

## Backend API Calls

```dart
// Use the configured base URL — never hardcode
final baseUrl = AppSettingsService.backendUrl; // or from config
final response = await http.get(Uri.parse('$baseUrl/api/endpoint'),
  headers: {'Authorization': 'Bearer $token'},
);
if (response.statusCode != 200) {
  // handle gracefully
}
final data = MyModel.fromJson(jsonDecode(response.body));
```

## Doc Comments

All public methods require a doc comment:
```dart
/// Loads all habits from local storage. Returns empty list if none saved.
static Future<List<HabitItem>> loadAll({required SharedPreferences prefs}) async { ... }
```
